    "name": "Chapter 1: Damage Reduction and Martial DC",
    "sourceHeading": "New Mechanics; Damage Reduction (DR); Martial DC",
    "content": "<h2>New Mechanics</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">This section includes all the major new mechanics introduced for AK5e.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>Damage Reduction (DR)</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Damage Reduction (DR) is a flat reduction to the Damage a Creature takes. It is applied <strong>before</strong> Resistances/Vulnerability, and can be specific to a particular Damage Type(s) (such as Fire), a class of Damage Types (such as Physical), or all Damage.<br>It cannot reduce the damage a Creature takes to less than 1.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>Martial DC</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Many Class and Branch Features make reference to a Character’s “Martial DC”. A Character’s Martial DC is equal to 8 + their Strength or Dexterity Bonus (their Choice) + their Proficiency Bonus.</p>",
    "rawSource": "## New Mechanics\nThis section includes all the major new mechanics introduced for AK5e.\n:\n\n### Damage Reduction (DR)\nDamage Reduction (DR) is a flat reduction to the Damage a Creature takes. It is applied **before** Resistances/Vulnerability, and can be specific to a particular Damage Type(s) (such as Fire), a class of Damage Types (such as Physical), or all Damage.\nIt cannot reduce the damage a Creature takes to less than 1.\n\n### Martial DC\nMany Class and Branch Features make reference to a Character’s “Martial DC”. A Character’s Martial DC is equal to 8 + their Strength or Dexterity Bonus (their Choice) + their Proficiency Bonus.\n\n <img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/3/3c/Ace.png?db8db0' \n  style='position:absolute;top:350px;right:230px;width:700px' />\n\n\n\\column",
    "rawSources": [
      "## New Mechanics\nThis section includes all the major new mechanics introduced for AK5e.\n:",
      "### Damage Reduction (DR)\nDamage Reduction (DR) is a flat reduction to the Damage a Creature takes. It is applied **before** Resistances/Vulnerability, and can be specific to a particular Damage Type(s) (such as Fire), a class of Damage Types (such as Physical), or all Damage.\nIt cannot reduce the damage a Creature takes to less than 1.",
      "### Martial DC\nMany Class and Branch Features make reference to a Character’s “Martial DC”. A Character’s Martial DC is equal to 8 + their Strength or Dexterity Bonus (their Choice) + their Proficiency Bonus.\n\n <img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/3/3c/Ace.png?db8db0' \n  style='position:absolute;top:350px;right:230px;width:700px' />\n\n\n\\column"
    ]
