    "slug": "rest-actions",
    "name": "Chapter 1: Rest Actions",
    "sourceHeading": "Rest Actions",
    "content": "<h3>Rest Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Many Features in AK5e, especially Tool Kits, reference Rest Actions, either as a \"Short Rest Action\" or \"Long Rest Action\". These are actions that you carry out over the course of their respective Rest, and provide some benefit if you complete them.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">To complete a Rest Action, you must complete the Rest while performing that Rest Action for the duration of that Rest. You can only perform one Rest Action at time.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">You can perform a Short Rest Action as if it were a Long Rest Action, but you cannot perform a Long Rest Action during a Short Rest.</p>",
    "rawSource": "### Rest Actions\nMany Features in AK5e, especially Tool Kits, reference Rest Actions, either as a \"Short Rest Action\" or \"Long Rest Action\". These are actions that you carry out over the course of their respective Rest, and provide some benefit if you complete them. \n:\nTo complete a Rest Action, you must complete the Rest while performing that Rest Action for the duration of that Rest. You can only perform one Rest Action at time.\n:\nYou can perform a Short Rest Action as if it were a Long Rest Action, but you cannot perform a Long Rest Action during a Short Rest.\n\n{{imageMaskCorner23,--offsetX:-47%,--offsetY:-60%,--rotation:0\n <img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/7/7b/The_Infected_Plight.png' \n  style='position:absolute;top:530px;right:130px;width:1000px;clip-path:rect(17% 73% auto auto);' />\n}}\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}",
